{"src":"en","tgt":"es","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":147400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"es","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5838.840291,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6148.955156,"text":"Los leones son los felinos más sociales que viven en grupos grandes llamados manadas."},{"kind":"audio","t":6204.670389000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6206.398277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6207.788997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6208.621999999999,"samples":24096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":16408.500606,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important. They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":16750.942968,"text":"En el clima cálido del Medio Oriente, la casa no era tan importante. Casi todas son playas de arena con baños seguros y la mayoría cuentan con sombra proporcionada por"},{"kind":"audio","t":16807.739817,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16809.211549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16810.826146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":16810.966107,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":16879.553219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16880.8842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16882.539509000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16884.532114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16884.76233,"samples":12928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":19268.113878,"text":"Bohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":19426.475603,"text":"árboles de Bohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":19480.628307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":19480.918313000002,"samples":2032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29412.761189,"text":"Prides are made up of one to three related adult males along with us. Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":29827.546068,"text":"Las manadas están compuestas por uno a tres machos adultos emparentados junto con nosotros. Los niños ferales pueden haber sufrido abusos infantiles graves o traumas antes de ser abandonados o huir."},{"kind":"audio","t":29884.584310000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29885.760368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29887.585141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29889.407751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":29889.596275,"samples":10528,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":250},{"kind":"audio","t":29927.920004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":29929.410895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29931.114887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":29932.880651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29934.141116,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":34421.402285000004,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 traverse regularly to Centra, stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":34856.54724,"text":"El autobús 403 de Scottport se desplaza regularmente hacia Centra, haciendo parada en Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":34914.528009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34915.95245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34917.997414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34919.701095000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34921.167209,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"input","t":40378.372783,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":40877.502643,"text":"Para obtener las mejores vistas de Hong Kong, salga de la isla y diríjase al paseo marítimo de Kowloon, justo enfrente."},{"kind":"audio","t":40936.520730000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40937.622987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40939.355923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40941.065192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":40942.616494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":40942.750135,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45407.38424,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":45786.095252,"text":"Se aceptaban las opiniones de Aristóteles en todas las cuestiones científicas, incluida la fisiología."},{"kind":"audio","t":45844.097052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45845.471609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45847.201299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":45848.917278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45849.404571,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":54560.763663,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor."},{"kind":"text","t":54965.057,"text":"El australiano Mitchell Gowrie terminó en el puesto 11 del Super G masculino, competidor de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":55022.708054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55024.279366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55026.029727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":55027.782832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55027.927089,"samples":8128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":60543.761546,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":60853.246434,"text":"Ulrich Joklin terminó en el puesto 16 del Super G masculino sentado."},{"kind":"audio","t":60908.226001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60909.637193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60911.39146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60911.882428,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":66591.515603,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":67043.594504,"text":"La ciudad contrasta fuertemente con el resto de las ciudades del país porque tiene más un aire árabe que un aire árabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":67101.82440700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67103.547717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67105.169505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":67106.863462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67108.196756,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":76668.003899,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":77230.054515,"text":"Además, tras la revolución, los puestos estuvieron abiertos a todos los solicitantes varones, permitiendo que los más ambiciosos y exitosos triunfaran."},{"kind":"audio","t":77293.224937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77294.560755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":77296.309925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77298.137252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77299.853512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77301.714259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77302.550436,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":83376.773104,"text":"The fusion bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":83827.683776,"text":"La bomba de fusión funciona bajo el principio de que se requiere energía para ensamblar un núcleo con muchos protones y neutrones."},{"kind":"audio","t":83887.951726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83889.340143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83891.102562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":83892.708025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":83894.474591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83894.750466,"samples":13760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":88734.915328,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":89161.548314,"text":"No estableció una cifra para los recortes, afirmando que se realizarán basándose en la producción económica de China."},{"kind":"audio","t":89221.642382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89223.019171,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":89224.770104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89226.59045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89228.310616,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":89228.436695,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96277.920047,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":96638.422881,"text":"No existe una definición universal de qué artículos manufacturados son antigüedades. Algunas agencias tributarias definen los bienes con más de 100 años."},{"kind":"audio","t":96695.252101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96696.62144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96698.382898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96699.56191,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":96734.830539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96736.170773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96737.926302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96738.129167,"samples":7296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":103555.334892,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":103864.298599,"text":"En el archipiélago y los lagos no necesitas necesariamente un yate."},{"kind":"audio","t":103918.017363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103919.620413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103921.384195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":103921.531867,"samples":8496,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":111881.024742,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":112522.762129,"text":"La relación de aspecto de este formato, dividiendo por 12 para obtener la relación de números enteros más simple, se dice por lo tanto que es de 3 a 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":112585.168322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112586.587406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112588.330266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112590.346186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112592.824341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":112593.609131,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112594.767382,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":120255.002121,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":120725.86728,"text":"Es reconocida por ser un epicentro del lujo que comenzó alrededor del año 400 d.C. y duró hasta u"},{"kind":"audio","t":120783.284704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120784.731849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120786.45918600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120788.154655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":120789.055469,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":124475.559092,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":124723.485584,"text":"hasta aproximadamente el año 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"audio","t":124774.385801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124775.964634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124776.143463,"samples":7064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":132185.321164,"text":"...policies vary, but as of late March, most coronavirus-based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics..."},{"kind":"text","t":132886.343221,"text":"...las políticas varían, pero a finales de marzo, la mayoría de las políticas de cancelación basadas en el coronavirus no se extienden hasta julio de 2020, cuando los Juegos Olímpicos..."},{"kind":"audio","t":132955.090898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132956.708099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":132958.32512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132960.14108,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132961.900635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":132963.67338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132965.399415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":132967.237247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":132967.339641,"samples":4256,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":140482.253583,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball WOOOOOO"},{"kind":"text","t":141037.848684,"text":"Mezcla los dos polvos secos y luego, con las manos limpias y húmedas, apriétalos hasta formar una bola WOOOOOO"},{"kind":"audio","t":141095.528883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141097.170431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141098.904257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":141100.66903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141101.755964,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":147087.105121,"text":"Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":147360.110313,"text":"Los pasajeros de crucero están exentos de los requisitos de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":147400.33409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147401.995988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147403.563695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":147403.668452,"sampl